GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_RepairStandSiteAndPumpSecurity> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_RepairStandSiteAndPumpSecurity> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_RepairStandSiteAndPumpSecurity> ;
    narr:childCount "2"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "1e59018ab1d2cc578d50010ca9832e543fcf8f6d" ;
    narr:narration """This position holds two supporting statements on the repair stand. [Anouk places the stand at the river path entrance rather than the car park, on the ground that the river path is where riders actually get flats](narr:Expr_20261014_3_Batch6Bikestand20261014023839_h84b7f13cbf89_1) — a siting claim grounded in where breakdowns happen. [Sami adds a security directive: chain the pump, because the last one disappeared within a week](narr:Expr_20261014_3_Batch6Bikestand20261014023839_h84b7f13cbf89_2). Together they cover where the stand goes and what it takes to keep its kit in place.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261014_3_Batch6Bikestand20261014023839_h84b7f13cbf89_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261014_3_Batch6Bikestand20261014023839_h84b7f13cbf89_2> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The public repair stand goes by the river path entrance, not in the car park. The river path is where the flats happen." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261014_3_Batch6Bikestand20261014023839_h84b7f13cbf89_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Put the pump on a chain; the last one walked off in a week." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261014_3_Batch6Bikestand20261014023839_h84b7f13cbf89_2> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The two statements pull in different directions: one optimizes for where riders break down, the other for protecting equipment — a visible, accessible site is also a theft-exposed one." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261014_3_Batch6Bikestand20261014023839_h84b7f13cbf89_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261014_3_Batch6Bikestand20261014023839_h84b7f13cbf89_2> ] ;
    narr:run "7c952f2b4fdf" ;
